      <bpmn:userTask id="W3860_Task5" name="Investigators gather evidence across systems (POS journal links to VS-08, CCTV…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Investigators gather evidence across systems (POS journal links to VS-08, CCTV links to VS-23, ecommerce logs links to VS-10, payment/chargeback data links to VS-80, loyalty/gift-card history links to VS-13/VS-54, returns history links to VS-32), interview/store-side checks via LP (links to VS-23), and document chain-of-custody
Responsible (R): Fraud Investigators / LP / Channels
Accountable (A): Fraud Management Lead
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3860_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3860_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3860_Task6" name="Investigators adjudicate (confirm/dismiss), apply outcomes (block/flag…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Investigators adjudicate (confirm/dismiss), apply outcomes (block/flag customer, reverse points/gift balance, restock hold, refer for recovery links to W3874 or law-enforcement links to W3877), and close with root-cause and learning fed to rules (links to W3862)
Responsible (R): Fraud Investigators / Legal
Accountable (A): Fraud Management Lead
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3860_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3860_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
