Volume: ~150–300 rules + 5–15 models under governance
Owner: Fraud Management / Risk
Participants: Fraud Management, Data Science (links to VS-30.2), Risk (links to VS-21), Internal Audit (links to VS-21), Model Risk (links to VS-21), Legal/Privacy (links to VS-91/VS-100), Channels (links to VS-07/VS-10/VS-80/VS-13)
