      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor need; contract cycle
Frequency: Per vendor + ongoing
Volume: ~5–12 fraud vendors (gateway fraud tools, device intel, chargeback platforms, consortium)
Owner: Fraud Management / Procurement
Participants: Fraud Management, Procurement (links to VS-34), Legal (links to VS-100.3), IT/EA (links to VS-27/VS-113), Privacy (links to VS-91), Finance (links to VS-17.4), ABC (links to VS-86.3)
Source: workflow W3863 — Fraud Vendor &amp; Third-Party Data/Tool Governance</bpmn:documentation>
