        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Fraud Management/Procurement/Legal select and contract fraud vendors/tools (fraud-scoring SaaS, device intelligence, chargeback-recovery, identity verification), with data-processing terms compliant with RA 10173 (links to VS-91), security review (links to VS-27.3), and ABC-compliant sourcing (links to VS-86.3)
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / Procurement / Legal
Accountable (A): Fraud Management Lead
