Responsible (R): Fraud Management / IT
Accountable (A): Fraud Management Lead
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3863_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3863_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3863_Task6" name="Fraud Management/Finance govern vendor spend and value (cost vs loss-avoidance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Fraud Management/Finance govern vendor spend and value (cost vs loss-avoidance links to W3864) and renew/retire on performance
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / Finance
Accountable (A): Fraud Management Lead
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3863_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3863_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
