    <bpmn:process id="W_W3864" name="W3864. Fraud Program Budget, Reporting &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual budget (links to VS-33.1); monthly/quarterly review
Frequency: Annual + monthly/quarterly
Volume: Fraud program budget &amp; loss-rate reporting (~PHP 0.3–0.9B/yr at-risk envelope)
Owner: Fraud Management / Finance
Participants: Fraud Management, Finance (links to VS-17.4), Risk/Internal Audit (links to VS-21), Insights (links to VS-28.1), Channels (links to VS-07/VS-10/VS-80/VS-13), Strategy (links to VS-33)
Source: workflow W3864 — Fraud Program Budget, Reporting &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3864_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3864_Lane1" name="Fraud Management">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3864_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3864_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3864_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3864_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3864_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3864_Start3" name="Annual budget (links to VS-33.1); monthly/quarterly review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3864_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3864_Task4" name="Fraud Management/Finance develop the fraud budget (team, technology links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Fraud Management/Finance develop the fraud budget (team, technology links to W3859/W3863, vendor data, recovery operations) and the gross/net fraud-loss target by channel, aligned to annual budget (links to VS-33.1/VS-17.4)
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3864_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3864_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3864_Task5" name="Fraud Management/Insights publish the monthly fraud loss-rate and KPI scorecard…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Fraud Management/Insights publish the monthly fraud loss-rate and KPI scorecard (gross loss, net loss after recovery, chargeback rate, false-positive rate, case SLA, recovery rate) by channel, reconciled to shrink (links to VS-23) and revenue assurance (links to VS-118) to avoid double-count
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / Insights
Accountable (A): Fraud Management Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3864_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3864_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3864_Task6" name="Fraud Management run continuous improvement: root-cause loss trends, reallocate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Fraud Management run continuous improvement: root-cause loss trends, reallocate spend to highest-loss channels, and report to the Audit &amp; Risk Committee (links to VS-21/VS-36)
Responsible (R): Fraud Management / Risk
Accountable (A): Fraud Management Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3864_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3864_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3864_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3864_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3864_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-604 (ensure controlled execution — Fraud Strategy, Governance &amp; Detection Platform (PA-125.1).) | - operational: reconciled scorecard; operational: loss-avoidance ROI analytics
Owner: Fraud Management / Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
